===Etymology===
From {{der|de|la|cummi}}, from {{der|de|grc|κόμμι}}, from {{etyl|egy|de}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈɡʊmi/|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-Gummi.ogg|Audio|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|n|g2=m|Gummis|gen2=Gummi|Gummis|pl2=Gummi}}

# {{lb|de|uncountable}} [[rubber]], [[gum]]
# {{lb|de|countable}} [[rubber band]], [[elastic band]]
# {{lb|de|countable|informal}} [[condom]], [[rubber]]

====Usage notes====
* The noun is almost exclusively neuter in northern and central Germany, almost exclusively masculine in Austria. Both genders are heard in southern Germany.

